ttps://www.aldiwan.net/poem50952.html","الرمل"],[240,"أهلا بطلعة زائر","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem31608.html","مجزوء الكامل"],[276,"ضحك تبروق الابرقين تبسما","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem52106.html","الكامل"],[286,"أمشرفي بصفاته وحلاه","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem1400.html",""],[308,"لي مطرب كملت محاسن وصفه","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem57806.html","الكامل"],[343,"للضيف أن يقرى ويعرف حقه","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem68815.html","الكامل"],[369,"خفض عليك وإن أطلت تأملا","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem60805.html","الكامل"],[402,"عاجت أصيلا بالرياض تطوفها","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem10987.html","عموديه"],[466,"أرج النسيم فقلت نشر خميلة","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem16338.html","الكامل"],[476,"ولقد دعوت طريفُ دعوة جاهلٍ","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem755.html",""],[520,"سهلت حزونة وجده وغرامه","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem12254.html","الكامل"],[563,"صح قولي إن السماع دواء","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem33528.html","الخفيف"],[597,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/138325",""],[816,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/107105","الكامل"],[1097,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/80219","الكامل"],[1100,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/133827","الكامل"],[1100,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/133770","الخفيف"],[1167,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/101980","الكامل"],[1343,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/109235","الكامل"],[1538,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/80002","الكامل"],[1703,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/141259","الكامل"],[1719,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/100960","الرمل"],[1899,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/52119","الكامل"],[2045,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/104820","الكامل"],[2045,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/104696","الكامل"],[2108,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/113738","الكامل"],[2220,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/27272","الكامل"],[2232,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diw